        <span class="tool-name">Rapture Mechanical Keyboard</span>
        <p>Mechanical and easy on the wallet. I'm honestly just here for the vibes and the clack.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tool-item">
      <div class="tool-icon"><Mouse size={22} /></div>
      <div class="tool-info">
        <span class="tool-name">A4tech Fstyler Mouse</span>
        <p>Bluetooth, silent clicks, works a charm. Nobody hears me rage-click. Nobody needs to.</p>
